<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for using a mage's skill using one skill.

how to use
F1 will use the skill once, all the time.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 58 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 58 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Ragnarok</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>